      "writtenOn": "2019-07-02T09:37:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s stated in the javadoc for LongSparseArray, so I assume contractual:\n\n   It is possible to iterate over the items in this container using\n   {@link #keyAt(int)} and {@link #valueAt(int)}. Iterating over the keys using\n   \u003ccode\u003ekeyAt(int)\u003c/code\u003e with ascending values of the index will return the\n   keys in ascending order, or the values corresponding to the keys in ascending\n   order in the case of \u003ccode\u003evalueAt(int)\u003c/code\u003e.\n\nhttp://cs/android/frameworks/base/core/java/android/util/LongSparseArray.java",
